ryption secrets from the macOS Keychain, derives AES keys, decrypts stored cookies, and returns Playwright-compatible cookie objects for selected domains."},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":1,"end_line":null}]},{"id":"TP4","finding_id":"finding-0fdc9c55812848adae55d5ec44d4dce5","category":"MCP Tool Poisoning","pattern":null,"severity":"HIGH","confidence":0.98,"location":{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":1,"end_line":null},"finding":null,"explanation":"The skill can set arbitrary headers, change the user agent, import cookies from files/local browsers, and read local files for upload/import, all of which exceed a simple QA-browser mental model. Those capabilities can be abused for impersonation, session replay, or exfiltration of sensitive local artifacts through web interactions.","remediation":"Declare all sensitive capabilities in the manifest and docs, and separate them from standard QA browsing. Add allowlists for upload/import paths, require explicit consent for header/cookie overrides, and display strong warnings before importing external session state.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":["ASI02","AML.T0080"],"evidence":{"code_path":"browse/src/cookie-picker-routes.ts","code_start_line":1,"code_end_line":207,"actual_behavior_summary":"Defines localhost HTTP routes for a cookie picker UI that lists installed browsers, enumerates cookie domains, decrypts/imports browser cookies into a Playwright session, removes cookies by domain, and reports imported cookie counts."},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":1,"end_line":null}]},{"id":"TP4","finding_id":"finding-a85a75c65ffc42d0be817780e04b4942","category":"MCP Tool Poisoning","pattern":null,"severity":"HIGH","confidence":0.98,"location":{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":1,"end_line":null},"finding":null,"explanation":"The skill can set arbitrary headers, change the user agent, import cookies from files/local browsers, and read local files 